      "description": "Posted: 2026-06-10\nPart time\n\nPosition Title: Microbiology for Health Professionals Lab Part-time Instructor ‌ Position Type: Fixed Term (Fixed Term) ‌ About the Role: The Department of Biological Sciences at Northern Kentucky University invites applications for part-time Instructors for Microbiology for Health Professionals Labs. ‌ Candidates must be prepared to teach a lab section of Microbiology for Health Professionals in a   fully face-to-face format on the   NKU   campus. Minimum of a Master’s degree in Biological Sciences with relevant microbiology experience. Completed applications will be kept on file for future opportunities. Please provide the following: CV/Resume List of references ‌ Work Environment & Physical Demands:"
